logical_plan
01)Projection: count(alias1) AS count(DISTINCT hits.SearchPhrase)
02)--Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[count(alias1)]]
03)----Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.SearchPhrase AS alias1]], aggr=[[]]
04)------TableScan: hits projection=[SearchPhrase]
physical_plan
