02)--AggregateExec: mode=Final, gby=[], aggr=[count(alias1)]
03)----CoalescePartitionsExec
04)------AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[], aggr=[count(alias1)]
05)--------AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[alias1@0 as alias1], aggr=[]
06)----------RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([alias1@0], 4), input_partitions=4
07)------------AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[SearchPhrase@0 as alias1], aggr=[]
08)--------------DataSourceExec: file_groups={4 groups: [[${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>]]}, projection=[SearchPhrase], file_type=vortex
